select count(*) into n from (select d."Goal ID",d."Initiative ID",d."Initiative Name",d."Sub Initiative Name",d."Start Date",d."End Date",d."Action Item",d."Status",d."Target 1",d."Target 2",d."Target 3",d."School" from public."Initiative_Data" d join public."Initiative_master" m on m."Initiative ID"=d."Initiative ID" and m."Goal ID"=d."Goal ID" join public."Goal_master" g on g."Goal ID"=m."Goal ID" where (false or (d."Role"='All' and m."Role"='All' and g."Role"='All')) order by d."Initiative ID",d."Sub Initiative Name",d."Action Item" limit 300) q;if n<>0 then raise exception 'Public initiativeData leaked private records';end if;
